      "source": [
        "# Unsupervised Learning Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: K-Means from scratch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import math"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import random"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def euclidean_distance(a, b):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return math.sqrt(sum((ai - bi) ** 2 for ai, bi in zip(a, b)))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def kmeans(data, k, max_iterations=100, seed=42):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    random.seed(seed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_features = len(data[0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    centroids = random.sample(data, k)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for iteration in range(max_iterations):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        clusters = [[] for _ in range(k)]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        assignments = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for point in data:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            distances = [euclidean_distance(point, c) for c in centroids]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            nearest = distances.index(min(distances))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            clusters[nearest].append(point)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            assignments.append(nearest)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        new_centroids = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for cluster in clusters:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if len(cluster) == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                new_centroids.append(random.choice(data))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            centroid = ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                sum(point[j] for point in cluster) / len(cluster)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                for j in range(n_features)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            ]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            new_centroids.append(centroid)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if all("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            euclidean_distance(old, new) < 1e-6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for old, new in zip(centroids, new_centroids)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        ):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  Converged at iteration {iteration + 1}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        centroids = new_centroids"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return assignments, centroids"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Elbow method and silhouette score"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def compute_inertia(data, assignments, centroids):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    total = 0.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for point, cluster_id in zip(data, assignments):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total += euclidean_distance(point, centroids[cluster_id]) ** 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return total"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def silhouette_score(data, assignments):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n = len(data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if n < 2:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return 0.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    clusters = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i, c in enumerate(assignments):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        clusters.setdefault(c, []).append(i)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if len(clusters) < 2:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return 0.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    scores = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(n):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        own_cluster = assignments[i]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        own_members = [j for j in clusters[own_cluster] if j != i]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(own_members) == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            scores.append(0.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        a = sum(euclidean_distance(data[i], data[j]) for j in own_members) / len(own_members)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        b = float(\"inf\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for cluster_id, members in clusters.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if cluster_id == own_cluster:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            avg_dist = sum(euclidean_distance(data[i], data[j]) for j in members) / len(members)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            b = min(b, avg_dist)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if max(a, b) == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            scores.append(0.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            scores.append((b - a) / max(a, b))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return sum(scores) / len(scores)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def find_best_k(data, max_k=10):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"Elbow method:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    inertias = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for k in range(1, max_k + 1):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        assignments, centroids = kmeans(data, k)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        inertia = compute_inertia(data, assignments, centroids)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        inertias.append(inertia)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"  K={k}: inertia={inertia:.2f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\nSilhouette scores:\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for k in range(2, max_k + 1):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        assignments, centroids = kmeans(data, k)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        score = silhouette_score(data, assignments)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"  K={k}: silhouette={score:.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return inertias"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: DBSCAN from scratch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def dbscan(data, eps, min_samples):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n = len(data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    labels = [-1] * n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    cluster_id = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def region_query(point_idx):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        neighbors = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i in range(n):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if euclidean_distance(data[point_idx], data[i]) <= eps:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                neighbors.append(i)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return neighbors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    visited = [False] * n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(n):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if visited[i]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        visited[i] = True"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        neighbors = region_query(i)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if len(neighbors) < min_samples:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            labels[i] = -1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        labels[i] = cluster_id"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        seed_set = list(neighbors)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        seed_set.remove(i)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        j = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while j < len(seed_set):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            q = seed_set[j]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if not visited[q]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                visited[q] = True"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                q_neighbors = region_query(q)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                if len(q_neighbors) >= min_samples:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    for nb in q_neighbors:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                        if nb not in seed_set:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                            seed_set.append(nb)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if labels[q] == -1:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                labels[q] = cluster_id"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            j += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        cluster_id += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return labels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Gaussian Mixture Model (EM algorithm)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def gmm(data, k, max_iterations=100, seed=42):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    random.seed(seed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n = len(data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    d = len(data[0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    indices = random.sample(range(n), k)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    means = [list(data[i]) for i in indices]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    variances = [1.0] * k"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    weights = [1.0 / k] * k"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def gaussian_pdf(x, mean, variance):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        d = len(x)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        coeff = 1.0 / ((2 * math.pi * variance) ** (d / 2))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        exponent = -sum((xi - mi) ** 2 for xi, mi in zip(x, mean)) / (2 * variance)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return coeff * math.exp(max(exponent, -500))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for iteration in range(max_iterations):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        responsibilities = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i in range(n):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            probs = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for j in range(k):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                probs.append(weights[j] * gaussian_pdf(data[i], means[j], variances[j]))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            total = sum(probs)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if total == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                total = 1e-300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            responsibilities.append([p / total for p in probs])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        old_means = [list(m) for m in means]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for j in range(k):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r_sum = sum(responsibilities[i][j] for i in range(n))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if r_sum < 1e-10:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            weights[j] = r_sum / n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for dim in range(d):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                means[j][dim] = sum("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    responsibilities[i][j] * data[i][dim] for i in range(n)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                ) / r_sum"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            variances[j] = sum("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                responsibilities[i][j]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                * sum((data[i][dim] - means[j][dim]) ** 2 for dim in range(d))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                for i in range(n)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            ) / (r_sum * d)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            variances[j] = max(variances[j], 1e-6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        shift = sum("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            euclidean_distance(old_means[j], means[j]) for j in range(k)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if shift < 1e-6:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            print(f\"  GMM converged at iteration {iteration + 1}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    assignments = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(n):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        assignments.append(responsibilities[i].index(max(responsibilities[i])))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return assignments, means, weights, responsibilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: Generate test data and run everything"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def make_blobs(centers, n_per_cluster=50, spread=0.5, seed=42):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    random.seed(seed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    data = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    true_labels = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for label, (cx, cy) in enumerate(centers):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for _ in range(n_per_cluster):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            x = cx + random.gauss(0, spread)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            y = cy + random.gauss(0, spread)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            data.append([x, y])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            true_labels.append(label)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return data, true_labels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def make_moons(n_samples=200, noise=0.1, seed=42):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    random.seed(seed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    data = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    labels = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_half = n_samples // 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(n_half):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        angle = math.pi * i / n_half"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        x = math.cos(angle) + random.gauss(0, noise)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        y = math.sin(angle) + random.gauss(0, noise)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        data.append([x, y])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        labels.append(0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for i in range(n_half):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        angle = math.pi * i / n_half"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        x = 1 - math.cos(angle) + random.gauss(0, noise)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        y = 1 - math.sin(angle) - 0.5 + random.gauss(0, noise)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        data.append([x, y])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        labels.append(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return data, labels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "if __name__ == \"__main__\":"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    centers = [[2, 2], [8, 3], [5, 8]]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    data, true_labels = make_blobs(centers, n_per_cluster=50, spread=0.8)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"=== K-Means on 3 blobs ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    assignments, centroids = kmeans(data, k=3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Centroids: {[[round(c, 2) for c in cent] for cent in centroids]}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sil = silhouette_score(data, assignments)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Silhouette score: {sil:.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== Elbow Method ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    find_best_k(data, max_k=6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== DBSCAN on 3 blobs ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    db_labels = dbscan(data, eps=1.5, min_samples=5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_clusters = len(set(db_labels) - {-1})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_noise = db_labels.count(-1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Found {n_clusters} clusters, {n_noise} noise points\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== GMM on 3 blobs ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    gmm_assignments, gmm_means, gmm_weights, _ = gmm(data, k=3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Means: {[[round(m, 2) for m in mean] for mean in gmm_means]}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Weights: {[round(w, 3) for w in gmm_weights]}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    gmm_sil = silhouette_score(data, gmm_assignments)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Silhouette score: {gmm_sil:.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== DBSCAN on moons (non-spherical clusters) ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    moon_data, moon_labels = make_moons(n_samples=200, noise=0.1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    moon_db = dbscan(moon_data, eps=0.3, min_samples=5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_moon_clusters = len(set(moon_db) - {-1})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    n_moon_noise = moon_db.count(-1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Found {n_moon_clusters} clusters, {n_moon_noise} noise points\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== K-Means on moons (will fail to separate) ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    moon_km, moon_centroids = kmeans(moon_data, k=2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    moon_sil = silhouette_score(moon_data, moon_km)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Silhouette score: {moon_sil:.4f}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"  K-Means splits moons poorly because they are not spherical\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(\"\\n=== Anomaly detection with DBSCAN ===\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomaly_data = list(data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomaly_data.append([20.0, 20.0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomaly_data.append([-5.0, -5.0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomaly_data.append([15.0, 0.0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomaly_labels = dbscan(anomaly_data, eps=1.5, min_samples=5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    anomalies = ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        anomaly_data[i]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i in range(len(anomaly_labels))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if anomaly_labels[i] == -1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"  Detected {len(anomalies)} anomalies\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for a in anomalies[-3:]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        print(f\"    Point {[round(v, 2) for v in a]}\")"
      ]
    },
